  <h1>Install SimpleDex on Android</h1>

  <p>SimpleDex for Android isn't on Google Play yet. Until it is, you can install it straight from GitHub, where each release is built from SimpleDex's <a href="https://github.com/StephenCavender/simpledex">open source code</a>.</p>

  <p><a href="https://github.com/StephenCavender/simpledex/releases/latest/download/simpledex.apk" class="btn btn-primary">Download SimpleDex (APK)</a></p>

  <h2>Install it</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>On your phone, tap <strong>Download SimpleDex</strong> above. If your browser warns that the file might be harmful, choose <strong>Download anyway</strong>.</li>
    <li>Open the downloaded <code>simpledex.apk</code> from the notification or your Downloads folder.</li>
    <li>If Android says your browser isn't allowed to install unknown apps, tap <strong>Settings</strong>, turn on <strong>Allow from this source</strong>, and go back.</li>
    <li>Tap <strong>Install</strong>. If Google Play Protect says it doesn't recognise the developer, tap <strong>More details</strong>, then <strong>Install anyway</strong>.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Once it's installed, you can turn <strong>Allow from this source</strong> off again in Settings → Apps → Special app access → Install unknown apps.</p>

  <h2>Updates</h2>
  <p>Most fixes download automatically the next time you open the app. Bigger updates need a new APK: download and install it the same way, over the top of the old one. Your offline data and theme are kept.</p>
  <p>To be told about new versions, use <a href="https://github.com/ImranR98/Obtainium">Obtainium</a> with this address, which installs updates for you:</p>
  <p><code>https://github.com/StephenCavender/simpledex</code></p>

  <h2>Check the download</h2>
  <p>Each <a href="https://github.com/StephenCavender/simpledex/releases">release on GitHub</a> lists the SHA-256 checksum of its APK. Only download SimpleDex from this page or that one.</p>

  <h2>Uninstall</h2>
  <p>Long-press the SimpleDex icon and choose <strong>Uninstall</strong>. This deletes everything SimpleDex stored on your phone.</p>

  <p>SimpleDex is an unofficial fan app. It isn't affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Nintendo, Game Freak, Creatures, or The Pokémon Company.</p>

